// 011.7c (#63): a case file that `#require`s a root Document and declares no rules or new types
// (only `Extend ... Identified by ...` domain atoms, initial state, and `Scenario`s) is valid,
// whereas declaring a new type, rule, or derivation in a case file is rejected with CHR043.
//! expect-error: CHR043
#require "include/document-owner.charter".

Extend Fact tenant Identified by Bob.
Fact extra-case-rule Identified by tenant
  Holds when True.
